HST Office: Vietnamese text read from Windows-1258 VBA sources is composed (NFC).

Windows-1258 stores most Vietnamese letters as a base letter and a combining mark, and the import
kept them so: `If x = "Việt"` did not match the same text from a cell or a control. Module source and
form captions from that code page are now composed on import. Saving converts back to the code page,
so the bytes in the file do not change. Other code pages are not touched.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/runtime/check-vba-forms.py.
